					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡茲加"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220505,
					"content": "（霍萊一口氣吞下清心，對著你們眨了眨眼…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍萊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220506,
					"content": "霍萊突然轉過身子，一口氣吃完了旁邊的半盆水果…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250220507,
					"content": "霍萊的食慾怎麼突然這麼好了？這種叫清心的東西效果有這麼好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
